{"availability":"available","full":"dshakes/distil","name":"distil","description":"Compression with a quality contract — cache-aware, causally-pruned LLM context compression for agentic runtimes, certified non-inferior across 7 domains. Works with any SDK.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":19,"forks":3,"created":"2026-06-21T17:17:24Z","updated":"2026-10-08T09:26:45Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://dshakes.github.io/distil/","topics":["agents","ai-infrastructure","anthropic","claude-code","conformal-prediction","context-compression","cost-optimization","llm","llmops","mcp","openai","prompt-caching","token-optimization"],"demo":"https://dshakes.github.io/distil/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T08:56:22.475Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T08:56:22.475Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T08:56:22.475Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T02:54:26.092Z","stars":18,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-09T08:56:22.475Z","stars":19,"forks":3}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Distil is the compressor that tells you when it is hurting you —and measures any other compressor, or your provider's own compaction, the same way.","About 9% off the real bill — the maintainer's own metered Claude Code traffic, 13,191 requests in September 2026, cache reads and writes priced in and distil's own spend netted out (source data, how the 8.3–9.2% range is derived). Your share depends on how much large, repetitive tool output your agent reads.","Other installs (curl, Homebrew, pipx, Windows): Install your way"],"features":["It doesn't break your prompt cache. Distil never rewrites bytes the provider still has cached; older context changes only once that cache has already expired. We shipped that bug once, measured what it cost, and made…","Every compressed byte is recoverable. What distil folds away it keeps in a local store, and the agent gets a distilexpand tool to pull the exact original back mid-task. How the digest works →","It's measured on a real bill, receipts included. Savings are counted per request and calibrated against the usage your provider actually bills; every request writes a hash-chained receipt you can verify. The number…","Certified, not estimated — a strategy ships only if a non-inferiority test passes; can't certify → full context.","An estimator that can report harm — the live check is a paired statistic, 1{A=B} − 1{A=A'}, with a bootstrap 95% CI and no clamp at zero. The old ratio estimator printed exactly 100% whenever chance favoured it and…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dshakes/distil/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"fa72d5994f69a4ed7062ac0dc242ba96a2e7f7b40b19a295972f11ff87427d8f","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:26.249Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:26.249Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Distil is the compressor that tells you when it is hurting you —and measures any other compressor, or your provider's own compaction, the same way.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dshakes/distil/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"It needs no API key and no spend, so it is wired into make gate and the CI gate job rather than run before a launch.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dshakes/distil/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"You usually don't need to pick. distil onboard detects your billing and sets the right mode for you — it writes it into your setup so every session just works.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dshakes/distil/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"optional","text":"40+ shipped capabilities, all real (no stubs): the cache-aware cost engine, causal pruning, the TOST gate + conformal certificate, the proxy + Anthropic/OpenAI/Gemini first-class adapters (Chat Completions, Responses API, and Gemini generateContent), an MCP server, LiteLLM/LangChain/LangGraph hooks, per-agent wrap presets, the Proof Ledger end-of-session printout, the…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dshakes/distil/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"fa72d5994f69a4ed7062ac0dc242ba96a2e7f7b40b19a295972f11ff87427d8f","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dshakes/distil/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:26.250Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-07T02:32:19Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dshakes/distil/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:26.256Z","hash":"fa72d5994f69a4ed7062ac0dc242ba96a2e7f7b40b19a295972f11ff87427d8f","originalBytes":102208,"storedBytes":102208,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["distil","every","tool","agent","model","one","wrap","what","docs","own","savings","python","claude","never","proxy","digest","only","expand","live","same","distil-llm","default","real","against","install","compression","output","mcp","measured","run","benchmarks","cache","code","results","gate","runs","turn","adr","read","tokens","examples","bash","compress","full","corpus","it.","url","base","recall","still","anthropic","any","context","line","mode","nothing","now","pass","request","traffic","client","cost","per","pip","provider","see","session","shadow","there","when","does","keeps","point","reversible","through","two","api","gemini","just","path","sdk","which","because","bench","certificate","each","fail","openai","over","rather","reads","sessions","subscription","certify","cli","how","messages","number","offline","shows","verbatim","why","back","before","certified","change","decision-equivalence","gateway","key","lossy","most","next","paired","prefix","setup","where","without","zero","about","budget","coding","hook","instead","json","lossless","once","original","out","tasks","bytes","command","content","doesn","file","handle","lossless-only","old","pipx","proof","raw","reports","saved","shipped","swe-bench","yet","bill","check","codex","config","floor","get","graded","keep","list","local","name","ot